tps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7029558?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq974969638","html_url":"https://github.com/qq974969638","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq974969638/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq974969638/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq974969638/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq974969638/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq974969638/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq974969638/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq974969638/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq974969638/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq974969638/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-24T05:39:30Z","updated_at":"2021-08-24T05:39:30Z","body":"I think there is a solution. Due to my limited technical ability, I don't know if this repair will cause other problems. Here I only provide my suggestions for your reference, thank you.\r\n\r\nThe original function:\r\n\r\n`function toValidAssetId(name, type) {`\r\n`    return `_${type}_${name.replace(/[^\\w]/g, '_')}`;`\r\n`}`\r\n\r\nRewritten as:\r\n\r\n`let element_name_map = new Map()`\r\n`let element_inc = 0`\r\n`function toValidAssetId(name, type) {`\r\n`    let retname = \"\"`\r\n`    let tempkey = name + type`\r\n`    if (element_name_map.has(tempkey)) {`\r\n`        retname = element_name_map.get(tempkey)`\r\n`    } else {`\r\n`        element_inc++;`\r\n`        retname = \"_\" + type + \"_\" + element_inc`\r\n`        element_name_map.set(tempkey, retname)`\r\n`    }`\r\n`    return retname`\r\n`}`\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLet's take the following code as an example:\r\n`<template>`\r\n`  <h1>{{ msg }}</h1>`\r\n`   <a-b></a-b>`\r\n`   <a.b></a.b>`\r\n`</template>`\r\n`<script setup>`\r\n`const msg = 'Hello World!'`\r\n`</script>`\r\n\r\nThe original function:\r\n`function toValidAssetId(name, type) {`\r\n`    return `_${type}_${name.replace(/[^\\w]/g, '_')}`;`\r\n`}`\r\n\r\nConvert \"a-b\" to \"a_b\"\r\nConvert \"a.b\" to \"a_b\"\r\n//This caused Vue SFC to generate the following code\r\n\r\n`return (_ctx, _cache) => {`\r\n`  const _component_a_b = _resolveComponent(\"a-b\")`\r\n`  const _component_a_b = _resolveComponent(\"a.b\")`\r\n\r\n//Error: duplicate variable name\r\n\r\nUsing the function I repaired, the following code will be generated:\r\n\r\n`return (_ctx, _cache) => {`\r\n`  const _component_1 = _resolveComponent(\"a-b\")`\r\n`  const _component_2 = _resolveComponent(\"a.b\")`\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease note: \"a-b\" \"a.b\" are all html element names that conform to the w3c standard:\r\n [https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#valid-custom-element-name](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/custom-elements.html#valid-custom-element-name)\r\n\r\nA valid custom element name is a sequence of characters name that meets all of the following requirements:\r\n\r\nname must match the PotentialCustomElementName production:\r\n\r\nPotentialCustomElementName ::=\r\n[a-z] (PCENChar)* '-' (PCENChar)*\r\nPCENChar ::=\r\n\"-\" | \".\" | [0-9] | \"_\" | [a-z] | #xB7 | [#xC0-#xD6] | [#xD8-#xF6] | [#xF8-#x37D] | [#x37F-#x1FFF] | [#x200C-#x200D] | [#x203F-#x2040] | [#x2070-#x218F] | [#x2C00-#x2FEF] | [#x3001-#xD7FF] | [#xF900-#xFDCF] | [#xFDF0-#xFFFD] | [#x10000-#xEFFFF]\r\nThis uses the EBNF notation from the XML specification. [XML]\r\n\r\nname must not be any of the following:\r\n\r\nannotation-xml\r\ncolor-profile\r\nfont-face\r\nfont-face-src\r\nfont-face-uri\r\nfont-face-format\r\nfont-face-name\r\nmissing-glyph\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/comments/904337879/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"qq974969638","id":7029558,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMjk1NTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7029558?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq974969638","html_url":"https://github.com/qq974969638","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq974969638/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq974969638/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq974969638/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq974969638/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq974969638/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq974969638/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq974969638/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq974969638/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/qq974969638/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"actor":{"login":"shadowings-zy","id":29225966,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MjI1OTY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29225966?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowings-zy","html_url":"https://github.com/shadowings-zy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowings-zy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowings-zy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowings-zy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowings-zy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowings-zy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowings-zy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowings-zy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowings-zy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowings-zy/received_events","type":"