"pushed_at":"2026-03-09T09:40:09Z","git_url":"git://github.com/vuejs/core.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:vuejs/core.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/vuejs/core.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/vuejs/core","homepage":"https://vuejs.org/","size":40047,"stargazers_count":53172,"watchers_count":53172,"language":"TypeScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":9062,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":985,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":9062,"open_issues":985,"watchers":53172,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/pulls/4429","html_url":"https://github.com/vuejs/core/pull/4429","diff_url":"https://github.com/vuejs/core/pull/4429.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/vuejs/core/pull/4429.patch","merged_at":"2021-08-24T15:48:09Z"},"body":"see issue #4422  \r\n\r\nIf component name is not strict, the generated render function will not run. \r\nWe can solve this edge case by adding an unique identifier on specific `validAssetId`.\r\n\r\nClose #4422 ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/4429/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/4429/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/comments/904419202","html_url":"https://github.com/vuejs/core/issues/4422#issuecomment-904419202","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/4422","id":904419202,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCCum18416FeC","user":{"login":"shadowings-zy","id":29225966,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MjI1OTY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29225966?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowings-zy","html_url":"https://github.com/shadowings-zy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowings-zy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowings-zy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowings-zy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowings-zy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowings-zy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowings-zy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowings-zy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowings-zy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shadowings-zy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-24T08:07:34Z","updated_at":"2021-08-24T08:07:34Z","body":"@qq974969638 I think we don't need using `Map` to store the relation of `name` and `element_inc`.\r\nI think we can solve this edge case by adding an unique identifier on specific `validAssetId`.\r\n\r\n```\r\nexport function toValidAssetId(\r\n  name: string,\r\n  type: 'component' | 'directive' | 'filter'\r\n): string {\r\n  // see issue#4422, we need add identifier if `name` has specific character\r\n  if (/[^\\w-]/g.test(name)) {\r\n    let identifier = ''\r\n    for (let i = 0; i < name.length; i++) {\r\n      identifier += name.charCodeAt(i)\r\n    }\r\n    return `_${type}_${name.replace(/[^\\w]/g, '_')}_${identifier}`\r\n  }\r\n  return `_${type}_${name.replace(/[^\\w]/g, '_')}`\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nPR #4429 \r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://